WEBVTT

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.920
<b>Christmas</b>

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:20.380
Christmas!

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:24.710
This is the place.

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:38.710
Did you think I'd just be asleep or something?

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.000
Wow. I'm impressed you're still awake.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:43.750
Victory is mine!

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:45.830
Okay, here. This is for you.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:47.580
Merry Christmas!

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Is this your way of admitting defeat?

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:54.170
Nope.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:56.330
Why would I? This is just a dream.

00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:57.380
Huh?

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:04.500
Guess what, Nishikata?

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:07.920
That's actually the special gift for couples.

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:13.880
NO WAAAAAAAY!

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:25.080
Just a dream...

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.960
<b>SPECIAL GIFT FOR COUPLES!!</b>

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:21.420
Hey!

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:25.920
Sorry I'm late, Takagi-san!

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:32.290
<b>Shikoku Ferry</b>

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:36.540
Thank you for choosing the Shikoku Ferry.
Your safety is our top priority.

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:42.210
Welcome aboard and we hope that you enjoy
the fun, pleasure, and convenience of today's ride.

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.630
The sea sure is pretty, huh?

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.000
Y-yeah.

00:03:57.960 --> 00:03:59.880
It's a good thing we made it onboard.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.380
Yeah, sorry.

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.830
I was late because I had a little something to take care of.

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:06.630
Jeez. You really had me worried.

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:08.750
I thought we were going to miss the movie.

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.250
That would have been a waste of these tickets.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:16.250
No kidding. Especially since you took
the time to pre-order them for us.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.710
Huh. There's a lot of kids around today.

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:22.630
Yep.

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.920
Today's the start of winter break, after all.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:25.750
Oh yeah.

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:27.330
Winter break does start toda...

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:32.710
Wait a minute! That means another year
of straight losses unless I beat her today!

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.630
She's teased the crap out of me this year!

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:39.460
At the very least, I want to end things on
a high note by claiming one win against her!

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:48.750
This is actually the first time I've been here.

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.540
Oh? That's cool.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:54.040
I've gotta think up some contest that I can win at.

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.080
Feels like we're in a big city.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.830
Yeah, sure does.

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:03.080
Takagi-san!

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:06.880
We've got time left until the movie.
Wanna check that place out?

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:10.630
<b>GAMELAND ARCADE</b>

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:10.630
<b>All claw machines 100 yen</b>

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:09.500
Oh! Totally!

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:18.710
<b>New</b>

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:18.710
<b>Prizes</b>

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:18.710
<b>Starting</b>

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:18.710
<b>Today</b>

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.380
Oh right, the Unrequited Love claw machine starts today.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.920
But forget that, I have to focus on our showdown!

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:26.040
I'm gonna challenge Takagi-san to the game that I'm best
at, "Wild West Bangety-Bang", and then totally crush her!

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:27.290
Ah!

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:30.040
This just started today! Look!

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:32.580
What? Oh, how about that.

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:35.750
I didn't realize. You know all about it, huh?

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:38.250
Yeah. I fell in love.

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:43.130
Oh. She just means she became
a fan of 100% Unrequited Love.

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:44.420
That freaked me out for a second.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:46.380
But wow, I had no idea.

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:49.250
Since when did Takagi-san get
so obsessed with the series?

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:51.170
Aren't you going to give it a try, Nishikata?

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:52.500
No, uh, I...

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:56.750
Hold on, this might actually work in my favor.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:00.000
I'm pretty confident in my claw machine skills.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:05.420
And it's the perfect chance for me to win the Kyunko and
Ikeo plushie set that I wanted without feeling any shame!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:05.250
<b>Pair Plushie</b>

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:05.250
<b>Limited Edition</b>

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:05.960
<b>Lovey-dovey</b>

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.960
<b>100% Unrequited Love</b>

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:10.040
Hey, Takagi-san. What do you say to a contest?

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:14.290
Whoever gets the prize from
this claw machine first is the winner.

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:15.330
Fine by me.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:17.540
Okay, Nishikata. You can go first.

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:18.880
Are you sure?

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:19.790
Go ahead.

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:23.000
Darn it, she doesn't even seem worried.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.380
Whatever, I'll show her!

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.880
Our last serious showdown of the year.

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.580
I'm gonna claim victory and look cool doing it!

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.290
Which prize are you going for?

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:34.000
Well, that's an easy one...

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:38.420
Ugh! The pair plushie is way back
in the worst place possible!

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.920
On the other hand, look at that puzzle!

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:45.500
<b>100%</b>

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:45.500
<b>UNREQUITED LOVE</b>

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:45.500
<b>PUZZLE</b>

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:43.130
It's on the verge of falling down the chute!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.500
It's practically asking me to win it!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.210
I don't really want the puzzle, but...

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:50.750
my shot at victory is right there!

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:53.670
What should I do? I gotta hurry and decide!

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:55.670
The puzzle!

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.580
Uh, that's what I want.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:59.790
Oh? I see.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.830
That's right! What I want most is to win!

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:06.290
And I don't care if I have to sacrifice
the pair plushie to do it!

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:08.250
Okay!

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.170
Now! Go for it!

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:13.460
That's it!

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.210
Aw, bummer.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.000
Okay. It's my turn now.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.960
I'm going for the pair plushie.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:33.460
Hooray!

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.750
How could this have happened?!

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.790
That pair plushie is what I really wanted all along!

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:43.710
I let myself get blinded by victory
and betrayed my true feelings.

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:46.130
Now I've lost the contest.

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:49.380
And... I also lost to myself...

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:52.920
Hey, Nishikata.

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:54.670
What?

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:57.880
Huh?

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:00.920
I'll give this to you, if you want it.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.580
No, I can't! You won it fair and square!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:04.790
It's fine, take it.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.750
E-even though you're a fan of it?

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:12.210
Oh, you mean when I said I "fell in love"?

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:13.710
Well...

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.960
I wasn't talking about
100% Unrequited Love when I said that.

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:18.080
Huh?!

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:22.040
What I actually fell in love with was...

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:26.380
claw machines!

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:33.790
We better get on our way.

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:34.670
Movie time!

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:43.880
Congratulations. Feels nice to get
the thing you wanted most, huh?

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.040
She knew!

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:51.540
This place is packed.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:52.580
Yeah.

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:57.130
Lots of couples, too.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:58.790
Seems like it.

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:02.080
I wonder if people are getting
a similar impression from us.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.130
I mean, we're here for the special couple gift...

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:07.380
I bet some of the people here are
just pretending to be couples.

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:09.040
You know, to get the special gift.

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:10.460
It's possible.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:13.540
I wonder what happens if they
find out they're not a real couple?

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:14.580
Dunno.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:18.630
I guess they wouldn't give them
the special gift. Or something.

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:20.960
Darn you, Takagi-san.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:25.130
I know you keep talking about all this "couple" stuff
on purpose just to embarrass me.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.330
But it's not gonna work!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.750
Nah, I don't think that would happen.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:31.710
Oh yeah?

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:35.500
How would they even be able to tell
a "fake" couple apart from a real one?

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:38.670
As long as people claim to be a couple
there's no proof otherwise.

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:40.380
Oh! Good point!

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:42.670
You've got it all figured out, Nishikata!

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:49.830
See that, Takagi-san?

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:54.000
Most kids would get totally flustered from saying
lovey-dovey words like "couple",

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.330
but I can handle it no sweat!

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:00.670
Excuse me.

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:06.170
Tickets for the Nishikata couple, please.

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:07.080
"Couple"?

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.290
Oh craaaap!

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:15.920
I meant to say "Tickets for the Nishikata RESERVATION"!

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:17.710
Mr. Nishikata?

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:18.420
Yes?!

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:22.330
You can use those machines over there
to print out your seating tickets.

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:26.250
Okay.

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:29.580
Mommy! I wanna hot dog!

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:30.540
<b>100% Unrequited Love The Movie</b>

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:30.540
<b>Theater</b>

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.080
Nishikata?

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:34.830
Look.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.330
<b>900 yen</b>

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.330
<b>100% In Love Popcorn Set</b>

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:38.750
Doesn't that set seem like a good deal?

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:41.210
<b>Some Sets</b>

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:41.210
<b>Come With</b>

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:41.210
<b>A Love Letter!</b>

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:43.710
Well?

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:45.170
Uh, sure.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:46.830
Let's get that.

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:51.170
All couples, please come here for your special gift!

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.170
I wonder what the special couple gift is?

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:55.830
Good question.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.420
Sorry, Takagi-san.

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:07.130
I'm gonna hit the bathroom first.
Could you carry this for me?

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:08.080
Sure thing.

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:10.500
Here, take this.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:12.830
It's your half of the couple gift.

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:14.420
Oh, thanks.

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:27.540
It already has "Merry Christmas" written on it...

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:48.830
I'm gonna sit... right next to her?

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:50.080
Seriously?

00:11:57.920 --> 00:11:58.920
Pardon me.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:01.290
Coming through.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:02.920
Pardon me.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:11.670
S-sorry.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:24.960
So what was it?

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:25.630
Huh?

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:26.920
The couple gift.

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:33.580
Huh? I totally thought you would have opened it
while you were in the bathroom.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.420
What? Oh... well, I didn't.

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:45.210
Ikeo dressed like Santa Claus, huh?

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:54.500
That's awesome!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:55.670
Such high quality!

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:13.750
S-sorry.

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:21.790
So where is it? You said you wanted
to go somewhere with me.

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:24.000
Huh? That's so weird.

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:26.460
I thought this was the right way.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:29.170
Kyunko! Watch out!

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:33.210
Squee.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:35.710
You okay?

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:36.880
Yeah.

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:43.290
It's beautiful!

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:46.580
Let me take a picture. I'll get you and Santa together.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:47.750
Really?

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:03.790
Kyunko, I'm going to be... your Santa Claus.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:06.670
From now until the end of time.

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:08.170
Forever!

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:12.790
Squeeeee!

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:28.000
<b>CAST</b>

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:28.000
<b>KYUNKO                     RIE TAKAHASHI</b>

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:28.000
<b>IKEO                     YUKI KAJI</b>

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:28.000
<b>TEACHER                     KYURO KAMIOKA</b>

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:28.000
<b>MANAMI                    RUMI NAKAKITA</b>

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:28.000
<b>RINKO                    RIN TAMAZAKURA</b>

00:14:23.260 --> 00:14:28.000
<b>OLD MASTER                    MITSURU ASHURA</b>

00:14:23.260 --> 00:14:28.000
<b>DOG                   MIKAN SHINSAKA</b>

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:42.170
Man! That was so good!

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:43.000
Totally.

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:44.960
It was so heart-warming.

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.710
Especially that one scene, you know?

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:50.460
Hey. Why're you trying to show off
more than usual today?

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.330
Because I wanted you to think I was hot stuff.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.380
W-well, you don't have to bother!

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:57.130
I prefer the regular you...

00:14:59.000 --> 00:14:59.880
That one.

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:01.710
Ah! That was a great scene!

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:05.420
Especially afterwards, when Ikeo
asks Kyunko what her type is.

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:06.330
Oh, yeah.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:09.750
Hey.

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:13.210
What kind of girl is your type, Nishikata?

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:17.040
I get the impression you're into girls like Kyunko.

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:19.460
H-hard to say...

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:23.960
You know, the cute airhead who
always tries her best. That type.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:27.500
W-well, I don't really think of her that way...

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:29.500
Oh?

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:32.920
Hey, Nishikata.

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.170
Wanna have a contest?

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:36.500
Sure, I guess.

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:40.670
We'll race to that power pole.

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:43.330
First one to touch it wins, okay?

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.830
What brought this on so suddenly?

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:48.790
What scheme is Takagi-san cooking up now?

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:51.080
Okay! Ready?

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:54.460
She's not even giving me time to think!

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:56.330
Go!

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:02.460
Whatever, I just have to go for it!

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:04.130
Move, legs!

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:18.380
Shucks, I lost...

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:21.540
D-did I just win?

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:23.250
For real?!

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.460
Yes!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.710
I've never felt so fulfilled!

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:32.210
That's what you get for underestimating me, Takagi-san!

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:36.130
She seems upset! And way more vulnerable than usual!

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:40.380
I get the feeling that I can beat her
at anything I challenge her to.

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:42.170
Takagi-san.

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.330
Guess. Which hand is the coin in?

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:54.040
Um... that one?

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:57.790
Too bad!

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:59.380
I'm the winner!

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:00.170
Aw!

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:04.420
That's so weird. I thought I picked the right one...

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:12.130
Something's off. Isn't she acting a little strange?

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.580
No, it's just my imagination.

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:18.750
I only feel that way because
it's the first time I've seen her actually lose.

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:25.750
There is no doubt now! I have completely
surpassed Takagi-san in every way!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:29.750
Check it out, Nishikata!

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:48.080
Sorry. I tripped.

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:52.750
I'm such a big klutz. How embarrassing.

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:56.830
A-are you okay, Takagi-san?

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:59.040
You've been acting strange for a while now.

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:00.750
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:03.750
I was just pretending...

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:05.170
that I was Kyunko.

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:09.580
Shucks, I lost...

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:13.080
That's so weird. I thought this was the right way.

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.630
I'm such a big klutz. How embarrassing.

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:18.920
That's what she was doing?!

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:21.540
I thought I had won, but...

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.670
it was just an illusion!

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.460
Why would you do that all of a sudden?

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.500
Because I wanted you to think I was cute, Nishikata.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:38.540
When she asked me my type earlier...

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.250
this was her goal?!

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:43.960
W-well, um, I...

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:49.460
That's not right! You're supposed to say the line!

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:50.130
Huh?

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:52.500
What line?

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:54.130
Oh!

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:57.250
Because I wanted you to think I was hot stuff.

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:09.790
Oh, but actually...

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:14.460
I was being totally serious when
I said I wanted you to think I was cute.

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:22.130
Th-that wasn't any line from the movie that I remember...

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:29.540
It's snowing.

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:44.580
Takagi-san?

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:46.250
For you.

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:52.250
I appreciate you coming today.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:19:59.000
Thank you.

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:03.000
Can I open it?

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.750
Uh, sure.

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.000
You're always...

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:11.330
trying to warm up your hands and stuff, so...

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:15.420
It's chilly out.

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:22.960
Okay. Here's my gift to you.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:29.250
Merry Christmas!

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:34.750
Th... thanks...

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:41.630
I didn't feel embarrassed like this at all in my dream...

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:45.000
Wait, isn't this...?

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:52.290
I was a little worried that you might not like it.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.130
But I'm glad now.

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:56.290
Since it snowed today.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:03.920
Except one thing...

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:06.960
you don't look cold at all.

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:10.630
A-actually, I'm freezing my butt off!

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:06.540
<b>Send A Christmas Card</b>

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:06.540
<b>To Someone You</b>

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:06.540
<b>Care About!</b>

00:22:58.580 --> 00:23:05.580
<b>Dear Takagi-san,</b>

00:22:58.580 --> 00:23:05.580
<b>Thanks for everything today</b>

00:22:58.590 --> 00:23:05.580
<b>From Nishikata</b>

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:37.250
<b>Dear Nishikata,</b>

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:37.250
<b>Thanks for another fun year</b>

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:37.250
<b>From Takagi</b>
